{"id":"31d813d8488beb16","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-lowforcomputable-machines.md","title":"可计算机器低性","display":"df-lowforcomputable-machines — 可计算机器低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines","aliases":["43-df-lowforcomputable-machines"],"display":"df-lowforcomputable-machines — 可计算机器低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]]","[[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.16.2.2, printed p.489 / PDF p.509","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-lowforcomputable-machines</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lowforcomputable-machines — 可计算机器低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de7c59f8aed598d2\" href=\"?note=de7c59f8aed598d2\" title=\"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.16.2.2, printed p.489 / PDF p.509"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de7c59f8aed598d2\" href=\"?note=de7c59f8aed598d2\" title=\"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_M\">\\(K_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16634b9fc07ef245\" href=\"?note=16634b9fc07ef245\" title=\"43-df-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-computable-prefix-machine</a>。复杂度取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\)</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty+c=+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty+c=+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}(A)\\iff\\forall M\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(N)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\,K_N(\\sigma)\\le K_M(\\sigma)+c]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}(A)\\iff\\forall M\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(N)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\,K_N(\\sigma)\\le K_M(\\sigma)+c]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>N与常数c可依赖M；这里不额外要求从M的编号统一求得N。机器低性是全体有限串的复杂度模拟，而非只比较A的初段。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"de7c59f8aed598d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"de7c59f8aed598d2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$M,N$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$。$\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}$ 与 $K_M$ 见 [[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]。复杂度取值为 $\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$，约定 $+\\infty+c=+\\infty$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"16634b9fc07ef245","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$M,N$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$。$\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}$ 与 $K_M$ 见 [[43-df-computable-prefix-machine]]。复杂度取值为 $\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$，约定 $+\\infty+c=+\\infty$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}","display":false},{"tex":"K_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"+\\infty+c=+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}(A)\\iff\\forall M\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}^A(M)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\,\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathrm{ComputablePrefixMachine}(N)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\,K_N(\\sigma)\\le K_M(\\sigma)+c]].","display":true}],"bytes":1459,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-388","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]] — 可计算机器低性"},{"id":"b6aad31891614c4b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForComputableMachines}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]，$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]。"},{"id":"2c0b8291767d13ef","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。机器低性采用 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]、[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]] 的接口；可计算可迹性的等价刻画见 [[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]、[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char]]。"}],"outgoing":["de7c59f8aed598d2","16634b9fc07ef245"]}